-- src:12090 | (iii) the extent of the director’s responsibility for any
-- src:12091 | failure by the company to comply with sections 138,
-- src:12092 | 190, 191, 196B, 197, 199 and 201; and
-- src:12094 | (b) as to —
-- src:12096 | (i) the extent of the director’s responsibility for the
-- src:12097 | causes of the company becoming insolvent;
-- src:12099 | (ii) the extent of the director’s responsibility for any
-- src:12100 | failure by the company to supply any goods or
-- src:12101 | services which have been paid for (in whole or in
