    IF `the matter is considered although the director has not been convicted or may be criminally liable in respect of it`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "even though the director has not been convicted or may be criminally liable in respect of any of these matters" says nothing of a director who has been convicted

